c(12, "§5.6; §8.1 #5; §8.6 #6; part 8 #6", "tactic", "The referral unlock — a monetization instrument nobody mentions: v2.58 (2024-02-28) shipped 'Unlock unlimited streaks when 10 friends join through your invite link', a free route past the exact barrier, and no reviewer mentions it — including the 4★ still complaining about the cap nine months later; outcome unknown: not discoverable at the paywall, ten referrals too high a bar, or removed; 'Given that 7 reviewers are already recommending the app unprompted, a referral unlock that the most motivated advocates do not appear to know about is worth an audit'; research #6", "referral unlock of unlimited streaks", "none", "0 mentions; 7 unprompted recommenders", "research", "absence-based", "generalisable", ["12003973648","6946540196"])
